  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"ucaa667f0\" id=\"ucaa667f0\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubfb1d9d9\" id=\"ubfb1d9d9\">该项目是一个宇宙无敌牛的项目，除了牛，啥也没有。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u369646d8\" id=\"u369646d8\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1761816961244-a6d5895b-99d0-4844-88ca-b4831dc355cb.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub8c9065b-b5a1-4818-87a0-2cf035adece%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub63e4afb-7a56-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A331.2%2C%22height%22%3A429%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A417794%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A414%2C%22originHeight%22%3A536%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A266%2C%22y%22%3A425%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A-18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A458%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A-15%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%237e8c97%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2e3eb45c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uff13e13b\" id=\"uff13e13b\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub8128c25\" id=\"ub8128c25\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">オレは海賊王になる男だ！</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u14dbcbca\" id=\"u14dbcbca\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0c28a900\" id=\"u0c28a900\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u01520c23\" id=\"u01520c23\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"wE0rd\" id=\"wE0rd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u82b17e6e\" id=\"u82b17e6e\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">为什么要学习控制热敏打印机？</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"hfLHM\" id=\"hfLHM\" data-lake-index-type=\"0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41c0d448\" id=\"u41c0d448\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">嵌入式开发的实践意义</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u91f2d640\" id=\"u91f2d640\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue11e2d27\" id=\"ue11e2d27\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">热敏打印机是物联网设备的常见输出模块，例如：</span></p><ul list=\"uc6333b46\"><li fid=\"u4f7b547f\" data-lake-id=\"uc2173100\" id=\"uc2173100\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4033698\" id=\"ud4033698\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">自动售货机打印订单</span></li><li fid=\"u4f7b547f\" data-lake-id=\"ubd740ee9\" id=\"ubd740ee9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua5e3a785\" id=\"ua5e3a785\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">智能家居系统的提醒标签</span></li><li fid=\"u4f7b547f\" data-lake-id=\"u357bfe5e\" id=\"u357bfe5e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u52af06bb\" id=\"u52af06bb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">工业传感器数据记录<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"uddd5786a\" id=\"uddd5786a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">学习控制它，能掌握</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud206c954\" id=\"ud206c954\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">硬件通信协议</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u637a1070\" id=\"u637a1070\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">（如UART、SPI，I2C）。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"Ha6yt\" id=\"Ha6yt\"><br></h3><h3 data-lake-id=\"H3WOo\" id=\"H3WOo\" data-lake-index-type=\"0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub6d688e6\" id=\"ub6d688e6\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">商业与创客场景需求</span></h3><ul list=\"ub44c448f\"><li fid=\"ud9cc425f\" data-lake-id=\"u21238812\" id=\"u21238812\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b137648\" id=\"u8b137648\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">低成本部署：热敏打印机模块价格低廉（几十元即可入手）。</span></li><li fid=\"ud9cc425f\" data-lake-id=\"uc2c03a32\" id=\"uc2c03a32\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5604b6ff\" id=\"u5604b6ff\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">创客项目：自制便携式票据打印机、智能称重标签机等。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u4689a321\" id=\"u4689a321\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uaa993721\" id=\"uaa993721\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"A61b6\" id=\"A61b6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u948d0d09\" id=\"u948d0d09\">掌握软硬件全栈开发</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u10feb793\" id=\"u10feb793\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua96d7dda\" id=\"ua96d7dda\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在这个项目里面，我们除了可以学习硬件电路设计，嵌入式软件开发，还可以学习上位机开发，从而打通软硬件，上位机，下位机开发全栈研发技能，真是嵌入式学习的良药啊。怎么样，要不要学？</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u37dece26\" id=\"u37dece26\"><span data-lake-id=\"u27e5cc77\" id=\"u27e5cc77\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"ID0JY\" id=\"ID0JY\"><span data-lake-id=\"u74c21742\" id=\"u74c21742\">黑马图片打印机</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ub4e29158\" id=\"ub4e29158\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1762097033161-747e6a0b-15e2-4b77-853f-1905f9c1a17c.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1002%2C%22originHeight%22%3A689%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d8d0cd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mQsw0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"ako1o\" id=\"ako1o\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a955801\" id=\"u4a955801\">牛马拍立得</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u070a0244\" id=\"u070a0244\"><span data-lake-id=\"u159b5aa0\" id=\"u159b5aa0\">对，下面这个牛马就是我，我就是下面这个牛马。它是通过采集摄像头画面数据，当我们单击打印图片就将当前摄像头画面数据通过打印机打印出来。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u09f8008a\" id=\"u09f8008a\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1762097930478-ded728f2-dd6a-4765-9a2a-1fc784da9acf.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1002%2C%22originHeight%22%3A689%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ada9a3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fYoDY%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"aAc3M\" id=\"aAc3M\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77457afb\" id=\"u77457afb\">文本打印机</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u6dd820d4\" id=\"u6dd820d4\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1762097334041-587b819b-9e9d-4e2b-8f16-a2c1dd57bbe1.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A978%2C%22originHeight%22%3A726%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f1f1f1%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nHhIj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"ev2OW\" id=\"ev2OW\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6b4f144e\" id=\"u6b4f144e\">麦当劳点餐系统</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u3d148b0d\" id=\"u3d148b0d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u34997f6d\" id=\"u34997f6d\">该项目为学习餐饮点餐系统研发例程，图片仅供参考。 如有侵权，我就多买两个麦当劳吧。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u762a6a6b\" id=\"u762a6a6b\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1762097684573-e477d1ed-38b8-4348-b903-e403bb313a73.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1202%2C%22originHeight%22%3A839%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9eee2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IVG0N%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua9158d02\" id=\"ua9158d02\"><span data-lake-id=\"u28b5b8ec\" id=\"u28b5b8ec\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6da2fb50\" id=\"u6da2fb50\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u82ce8d22\" id=\"u82ce8d22\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\">项目采购地址</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u655b883c\" id=\"u655b883c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\">：</span></strong><a href=\"https://item.taobao.com/item.htm?id=991400976412\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u94236970\" id=\"u94236970\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uda7f9899\" id=\"uda7f9899\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\">https://item.taobao.com/item.htm?id=991400976412</span></strong></a></p>",
